1. `python/callbacks` — remove hardcoded network paths.
2. The RF-DETR extension — establish one owning component reference.
3. The inference Script TOP — resolve internal operators from the component.
4. Installer code — pass the component or log DAT into the installer.
5. Model loading — separate model storage paths from TouchDesigner operator paths.

TouchDesigner extensions are designed to provide component-specific functionality, and the component's extension system supports this ownership pattern.&#x20;

